    "title": "Rosebud fatal shooting; Pischke arrested; Hot and Humid - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Skylar Fisher ,\n15 hours ago\nSIOUX FALLS, S.D. (KELO) — Here’s a look at today’s top stories for KELOLAND On the Go.\nThe Rosebud Sioux Tribe Law Enforcement is offering a $10,000 reward for information about a suspect in a shooting death that happened Monday morning. The shooting happened in the early morning hours on Monday, resulting in the death of Tylen Valandra.\nRosebud Tribe offers $10K reward in fatal shooting case Republican State Sen. Tom Pischke has agreed to step back from his duties with the South Dakota Republican Party amid felony charges. Pischke is out on bond after turning himself into the Minnehaha County Jail for allegedly offering a false or forged instrument for filing.\nState Sen. Pischke arrested for false/forged documents",
